			description: ["Arguably &othe&r resource for circuits, you'll need a large amount of silicon. There are a few ways to produce it reliably, in LV you can electrolyze Silicon Dioxide dust for small quantities, and once you start getting MV machines you can also electrolyze clay dust. This is a more difficult to renew option, but gives additional resources such as Aluminium that make it more appealing."]
